// src/config/convertedAppPages.ts
//
// The React conversions of the awesome-llm-apps Streamlit apps
// (src/pages/agents/, generated by scripts/conversion/), keyed by the slug the
// App Library uses. The library opens an app at /dashboard/apps/:slug; when
// the app has a conversion here, that page is what opens.
//
// WHY AN EXPLICIT MAP
//   The pages are named after the original Streamlit folders and the catalog
//   uses newer names, so nothing linked them: the library opened the generic
//   runner for apps that had a full React conversion. Each entry here was
//   checked against the page it points at. Apps not listed have no
//   conversion yet and open the runner.
//
// Every page sends its runs as its own catalog slug (runViaRunner), so the
// server uses that app's config — not another app's.

